WEBVTT

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:02.800
Hold it for one minute.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.760
Ready, start!

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:11.210
Keep your body completely straight.

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:17.460
10 seconds to go!

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:22.710
3, 2, 1!

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:26.300
That was brutal!

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.800
I'm beat!

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.880
You feel that way because
you have no core strength.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.090
It's not simply a matter of
building up your muscles.

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:39.760
It's crucial to focus on training
the ones necessary for cheerleading.

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:45.090
We're so lucky that Sho joined us.

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:49.010
You're a big help. I'd like us to
start practicing stunts soon, too.

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:50.960
Huh? But...

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:54.590
Sho already said he won't do them.

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:58.880
I won't do any stunts.

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:00.960
I didn't say I wouldn't teach you any.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:06.130
It'd be bad if you amateurs hurt
yourselves trying to copy them.

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:07.760
Then I'll leave that to you.

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:11.710
Ton said stunts are the stuff you see
in group gymnastics, right?

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:15.050
And you do them with
the flyer, bases, and spotter.

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:20.840
We did some research, too!

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:23.010
Now we're finally getting
more cheerleader-like.

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:23.840
Yeah!

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:25.840
Right, we're kicking into high gear!

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:27.130
Woo!

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:52.460
<i>I'll put an end to spending</i>
<i>my days so thoughtlessly</i>

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:56.510
<i>I'm dying to break free of this</i>

00:01:56.510 --> 00:02:02.210
<i>Since I can never take that first step forward,</i>

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:06.300
<i>you always take my hand and pull me along</i>

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:12.130
<i>You've brought me to see</i>
<i>something completely new</i>

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:14.420
<i>My whole world is changing</i>

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:17.630
<i>With that first step</i>

00:02:17.630 --> 00:02:20.800
<i>I felt transformed</i>

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:25.760
<i>I can go anywhere; it'll work</i>
<i>out so long as we're together</i>

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:27.380
<i>Go on, fly high, </i>

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:29.010
<i>just as you are</i>

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:32.170
<i>At times you'll feel lost and scared,</i>

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:38.670
<i>but there are so many things you</i>
<i>won't know if you never give them a go</i>

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:40.300
<i>Go on, fly high, </i>

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:45.170
<i>stretch out your hands until</i>
<i>you're almost touching the sky</i>

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:48.420
<i>We're not alone anymore</i>

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:53.550
<i>Together we'll fly into a new world</i>

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:07.090
There are lots of stunts to choose from.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:20.630
These drawings really suck.

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:23.340
They're even worse than Kazu's.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:26.090
Were these carved into
some prehistoric clay pot?

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:29.260
They're certainly... something.

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:31.050
That's not the point here, guys.

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:33.010
Well then...

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:37.710
The one stunt I definitely want
to perform is the Elevator.

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:40.090
Let's see...

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:42.010
This one.

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:46.420
The bases lift the flyer to chest height.

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:51.760
Then they do an Extension, a basic stunt
where they extend their arms while standing up.

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:56.170
For one stunt called the Basket Toss,
they throw the flyer into the air.

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:58.050
It's the highlight of the performance.

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:06.340
All right, let's decide on our
positions soon and practice it!

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:11.300
Sorry for making you look
after the place. Thanks a lot!

00:04:14.510 --> 00:04:17.800
We need a practice area with a roof.

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:19.590
Anything we could rent?

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:23.510
The local gyms determine
borrowing privileges by lottery.

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:26.210
So long as it ain't too
expensive, anywhere's fine.

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:27.880
Should we collect dues?

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:30.760
We'll have to get uniforms
at some point anyway.

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:34.170
Unisex is the rage these days,
so let's get unisex ones!

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.880
You just want to say the word "unisex."

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:40.590
Uniforms will cost quite a lot, won't they?

